        "fields": {
            "description": "Terry Jones, the pastor of a tiny church in Gainesville, Florida has announced an “International Burn a Quran Day” in early September. Normally the President wouldn't need to care about something like this, but this has exploded into an international story. Muslims worldwide are furious. Protests have already started in Afghanistan, and our commanders are warning that actually burning the Qurans could put American troops in danger. Pastor Jones isn't breaking the law here, and what he's planning is ultimately protected speech. That said, this could end very, very badly."
        }
