            "description": "It's official. Osama bin Laden was killed during the raid, and the country has erupted. Crowds are gathering outside the White House and in Times Square chanting \"USA!\" Daniels has issued a statement congratulating the intelligence community and the men who carried out the operation. Your approval numbers are already moving. In a few minutes you're going to address the country. For a President who has spent his career arguing against war as an instrument of policy, this may be one of the strangest speeches you'll ever give. What do you say?"
